Licensing exception for the vendored jars in libs/
--------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above applies to this project's own source code and to
everything distributed in this repository EXCEPT the contents of the libs/
directory.

The jars vendored in libs/ (gst1-java-fixups) are separate works of their
respective copyright holders, licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License version 3 only. They are redistributed under the terms of that
license — see libs/LICENSE for the notice, the license text and where the
corresponding source code lives. The MIT grant above neither applies to nor
covers those files.

The runnable JAR produced by the build shades (embeds compiled classes of)
the LGPL-licensed gst1-java-fixups library: anyone distributing the runnable
JAR receives those embedded parts under LGPL version 3. The corresponding
source remains available in the -sources jar in libs/.
